    "title": "GATEWAY-batchinsertion-List Streaming Subscriptions Historys-v3-spec",
    "description": "The Streaming Subscriptions History API allows businesses to access detailed records of their streaming subscriptions. This endpoint provides a comprehensive overview of past subscription activities, including start and end dates, changes in status, and other relevant historical data. It is particularly useful for analytics, auditing, and customer support teams seeking to track and manage subscription performance. By integrating this API, developers can enhance their applications with subscription intelligence, thereby improving user engagement and operational decision-making.",
